#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:1
#: 25ddc4545d7c4ca68425626101b81aa4
msgid "Classical algorithm engineer"
msgstr "传统方案算法工程师"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:3
#: 9053b66ba95943b9a7c428a3d2c394ae
msgid ""
"For engineers who keep their own vision, planning, or visual-servoing "
"stack and need a stable Python / ROS 2 interface to the robot."
msgstr "面向自带视觉、规划或视觉伺服栈、需要稳定 Python / ROS 2 接口控机器人的工程师。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:5
#: eb78a85dc8d74eb2be2ff0ed581d1b50
msgid "1. Workspace and a moving robot"
msgstr "1. 工作空间和能动的机器人"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:7
#: ad0e9816948242bd9f2d4d3de54fb7e8
msgid ""
"[Install Environment](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — "
"Ubuntu 24.04, ROS 2 Jazzy."
msgstr ""
"[安装环境](../1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md) — Ubuntu 24.04、ROS "
"2 Jazzy。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:8
#: 6593f07a38cf4c76b623d04f401abfbc
msgid ""
"[open-deploy-ws Setup](../1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md) or a "
"lean-branch how-to if you are on a single public robot."
msgstr ""
"[open-deploy-ws "
"配置](../1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md)；若只做一台公开机器人，用对应精简分支操作指南。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:9
#: 6cbdc208f4a0485abdb982e2189477da
msgid ""
"[Run Mock Demo](../2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md) — "
"confirm FSM / motion before hardware."
msgstr ""
"[运行 Mock 演示](../2-how_to/1-basic_operations/1-run_mock_demo.md) — "
"上真机前先确认状态机 / 运动。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:10
#: 1e45bb96dc0540faba255a82588297f9
msgid ""
"[Switch Robot](../2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md) — "
"`robot:=` key and end-effector `type` / `left_type` / `right_type`."
msgstr ""
"[切换机器人](../2-how_to/1-basic_operations/2-switch_robot.md) — `robot:=` "
"键和末端 `type` / `left_type` / `right_type`。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:12
#: 5e07760d8aa949869c3955b68fee02fa
msgid "2. Install the Python interface"
msgstr "2. 安装 Python 接口"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:14
#: 52b71ecf363349bda04ac9d55305d51a
msgid ""
"[fa-py-libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md) — "
"`./init.sh all` (Python 3.12)."
msgstr ""
"[fa-py-libraries](../4-reference/python_apps/2-fa_py_libraries.md) — "
"`./init.sh all`（Python 3.12）。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:15
#: bac1415acd524807bb0474e619feea40
msgid ""
"[Python Interface](../2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md) — "
"`ROS2RobotInterface`, handlers, read state."
msgstr ""
"[Python 接口](../2-how_to/3-programming/5-python_interface.md) — "
"`ROS2RobotInterface`、handler、读状态。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:16
#: 850c7cd4f6264967af24dadc8cac49e6
msgid ""
"[ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)"
" — API names used on those pages."
msgstr ""
"[ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)"
" — 上述页面用到的 API 名。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:18
#: 1e2d02d977ec424893844c5c67ad3e6f
msgid ""
"Entry is the fa-py-libraries env, not `pip install ros2-robot-interface` "
"on system Python."
msgstr "入口是 fa-py-libraries 环境，不是在系统 Python 上 `pip install ros2-robot-interface`。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:20
#: e085b221461d4112bec6240803359212
msgid "3. Hook your own vision or servoing"
msgstr "3. 接入自有视觉或伺服"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:22
#: 7007b9760b5541cfa6c148a14e88ac0d
msgid ""
"This site does **not** document a vision-guided or visual-servoing "
"pipeline (no camera calibration how-to, no servo gain list)."
msgstr "本站 **没有** 视觉引导或视觉伺服流水线文档（没有相机标定操作指南，也没有伺服增益表）。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:24
#: ad5f5c15933941f98739b332029469e5
msgid "Use the interface as the robot side of **your** loop:"
msgstr "把接口当作 **你自己** 回路的机器人一侧："

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:26
#: 63bd50c072d3422a9aedf06b2e3f4a21
msgid ""
"Cartesian: `left_arm_handler.send_target_stamped` / `get_pose` on "
"[ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)"
msgstr ""
"笛卡尔：`left_arm_handler.send_target_stamped` / `get_pose`，见 "
"[ros2_robot_interface](../4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md)"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:27
#: 731b9a5b0aae4f2ea7b7e370b33141d2
msgid "Joints: `left_arm_handler.send_joint_positions` / `get_joint_state`"
msgstr "关节：`left_arm_handler.send_joint_positions` / `get_joint_state`"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:28
#: 73a8587e72884441b45f524a84f50ff8
msgid ""
"Blocking MoveL / MoveJ: `execute_movel_action` / "
"`execute_joint_trajectory_action` (Action, not the topic rows)"
msgstr ""
"阻塞式 MoveL / MoveJ：`execute_movel_action` / "
"`execute_joint_trajectory_action`（Action，不是话题行）"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:29
#: 735f030f22ee446fbbce099e9b9158cd
#, #
msgid ""
"FSM: [FSM and Topics](../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md) (`/fsm_command` "
"is `std_msgs/Int32`; WBC `/mode_command` needs 全身)"
msgstr ""
"FSM：[FSM 与话题](../3-concepts/4-fsm_and_topics.md)（`/fsm_command` 是 "
"`std_msgs/Int32`；WBC 的 `/mode_command` 需要全身）"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:31
#: 8d67c8a17e22403b84c583be386c3660
msgid ""
"Camera plugins under "
"[lerobot_ros2](../4-reference/python_apps/4-lerobot_ros2.md) "
"(`lerobot_camera_ros2`) are for **dataset recording**, not a visual-servo"
" controller."
msgstr ""
"[lerobot_ros2](../4-reference/python_apps/4-lerobot_ros2.md) "
"下的相机插件（`lerobot_camera_ros2`）用于 **数据集录制**，不是视觉伺服控制器。"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:33
#: 2002d22dda2646578c4f52a1bb68f6fe
msgid "4. Optional: see the robot while you debug"
msgstr "4. 可选：调试时看机器人"

#: ../../source/6-more_applications/2-classical_algorithm.md:35
#: 954bc47ed6484c6c905200cf605040d0
msgid ""
"[ros2-viser](../4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md) — `./run.sh "
"viser` after the stack is up."
msgstr ""
"[ros2-viser](../4-reference/python_apps/3-ros2_viser.md) — 栈起来后执行 "
"`./run.sh viser`。"

